name: Sprott R
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case R) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 0.9 [0.5, 1.5]
param b = 0.4 [0.1, 0.8]

dx = a - y
dy = b + z
dz = x*y - z
